Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-epgtoxml
Version: @VERSION@
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Arcardy
Homepage: https://github.com/Arcardus/epgtoxml
Depends: enigma2, python-core, python-json, python-xml, python-sqlite3
Description: Task-based EPG importer for Enigma2 (Sky.de, DAZN)
 EpgToXml fetches EPG data from modular providers (currently Sky.de and
 DAZN Live-TV) and imports it directly into the Enigma2 EPG cache on
 Dreambox/Newnigma2 OE2.5/OE2.6 receivers. The EPG import engine is
 embedded (derived from EPGImport, GPLv2); no external EPGImport plugin
 is required.
